{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"f869e09781be1ba5","type":"text","text":"\n| Business Rule                                                          | DQ Rule                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       | SQL query                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  | Issues                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| All critical fields in Chart of Accounts must be present and populated | meta_testing_115.coa_hierarchy_format_in.dim IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(meta_testing_115.coa_hierarchy_format_in.dim)) = '' OR meta_testing_115.coa_hierarchy_format_in.member_name IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(meta_testing_115.coa_hierarchy_format_in.member_name)) = '' OR meta_testing_115.coa_hierarchy_format_in.parent_name IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(meta_testing_115.coa_hierarchy_format_in.parent_name)) = '' | \"SELECT * FROM dev_demo.meta_testing_115.coa_hierarchy_format_in coa WHERE coa.dim IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(coa.dim)) = '' OR coa.member_name IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(coa.member_name)) = '' OR coa.parent_name IS NULL OR LTRIM(RTRIM(coa.parent_name)) = '' | \"The business rule specifies that all critical fields must be populated, but the data quality rule checks for NULL or empty values for specific fields only.\",<br><br>\"The data quality rule does not explicitly check if all critical fields are present, only if they are not NULL or empty.\" |\n","x":-620,"y":-700,"width":2020,"height":471},
		{"id":"32669485169cb8d8","x":-40,"y":-3960,"width":650,"height":2061,"type":"text","text":"Input: business_context document\n\n→ Load DQ Context (once, before chunking)\n→ Chunk context into pieces\n\nFor each chunk (LangGraph maintains state):\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ AGENT STATE (persists across chunks)        │\n  │ - dq_context: str                           │\n  │ - ontology_context: dict                    │\n  │ - processed_chunks: []                      │\n  │ - all_extracted_rules: []                   │\n  │ - discovered_columns_cache: {}              │\n  │ - generated_rule_names: set()               │\n  │ - existing_rules: []                        │\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n  \n  Step 1: Extract Business Rules (LLM Node)\n    Input: chunk_text + dq_context + ontology\n    Output: [{business_rule: str}, ...]\n    → Deduplicate against all_extracted_rules\n    → Add to state.all_extracted_rules\n  \n  Step 2: Parse Column References (LLM Node)\n    Input: business_rule\n    Output: {column_references, relationship, validation_type}\n    → Build semantic search query\n  \n  Step 3: Find Matching Columns (Tool Node)\n    Input: search_query + dq_context\n    Output: top 2 columns per reference with metadata\n    → Cache in discovered_columns_cache\n  \n  Step 4: Generate Technical Specs (LLM Node)\n    Input: business_rule + discovered_columns + existing_rule_names\n    Output: {data_quality_rule, be_sql_query, fe_sql_query, ...}\n    → Check duplicates via LLM\n    → Persist to MongoDB\n    → Send to external API if mapped"}
	],
	"edges":[]
}